<title>UK: Israel's Q Group to list shares in London.</title>
<headline>Israel's Q Group to list shares in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Q Group, a producer of interactive language and business studies courses, said on Tuesday it plans to list on the London Stock Exchange's Alternative Investment Market (AIM) in March.</p>
<p>The group said it intends to raise up to five million stg in a placing valuing it at between 15 and 20 million stg.</p>
<p>&quot;London is the ideal centre for a publishing company geared to meeting the worldwide demand for English language skills,&quot; said chief executive Roberta Stock.</p>
<p>The sponsor to the placing is Deloitte &amp; Touche Corporate Finance and the broker is Burrough Johnstone.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
